  "project_description": "Resets the sent status of an already-sent Simplenews newsletter issue back to \"not sent\" (SIMPLENEWS_STATUS_SEND_NOT), so the issue can be sent again through Simplenews' normal send flow without cloning the node or editing the status value in the database. Adds a permission-gated \"Reset newsletter status\" node operation and a confirm form; it does not itself send mail, it only clears the sent flag so Simplenews will send the issue again.",
